# Keep the audited OSQP v1.0.0 vendor snapshot byte-for-byte upstream.
# Its upstream documentation has historical whitespace; ATS source remains
# subject to the repository's normal diff whitespace checks.
# The upstream documentation also contains literal seven-character conflict
# examples.  A larger vendor-only marker size prevents diff --check treating
# those unchanged examples as ATS merge artifacts.
third_party/osqp/** -whitespace conflict-marker-size=255
